VISUAL: "EU AI ACT ARTICLE 50" text: "AI output must be marked in a machine-readable format".
AUDIO: 'brief that started this video wondered whether platforms might begin favoring signed originals in the ranking. They might. No platform has announced anything like it, so treat that as a hope and not a plan. What\'s real is the pressure, because since the 2nd of'

[10:01] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'August, the EU\'s AI Act has required AI output to be marked in a machine-readable format. The plumbing is going in either way, which leaves the question worth arguing about. What does an unsigned photo become once signing is'

